    "Blocks all traffic outside the tunnel, including if it drops. If LockPlus's tunnel process crashes, macOS lets traffic through for under 2 seconds until it restarts it." : {
      "comment" : "Kill switch footer (§6.4); the crash window is S2 E1 (DESIGN §20 risk 24)",
