            "value" : "Der Text ist keine %@-Konfiguration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel addresses of this Mac, as CIDR (10.8.0.2/32, fd00::2/128)." : {
      "comment" : "WG reference",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Tunneladressen dieses Mac als CIDR (10.8.0.2/32, fd00::2/128)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel component couldn't be removed, for example because the administrator password dialog was cancelled. Your profiles and LockPlus itself were kept. Try again to finish uninstalling." : {
      "comment" : "Uninstall, deactivation failed (§4.4 step 6, §6.13)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Tunnelkomponente konnte nicht entfernt werden, zum Beispiel weil die Abfrage des Administratorpassworts abgebrochen wurde. Deine Profile und LockPlus selbst wurden behalten. Versuche es erneut, um die Deinstallation abzuschließen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel component didn't answer in time." : {
      "comment" : "Error message",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Tunnelkomponente hat nicht rechtzeitig geantwortet."
