        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ stopped: %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ couldn't connect: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Problem: a start made elsewhere (System Settings) was refused while another profile is current (E2E-4 200012)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ konnte keine Verbindung herstellen: %2$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ couldn't connect: %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LockPlus is quitting." : {
      "comment" : "Editor error: the app is quitting (pre-release review)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LockPlus wird beendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not every profile could be imported, so settings, Wi-Fi rules and history weren't imported yet. Choose Finish Import to try again." : {
      "comment" : "Migration report: a profile failed; the global steps wait for the retry (pre-release review M2)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht jedes Profil konnte importiert werden, deshalb wurden Einstellungen, WLAN-Regeln und Verlauf noch nicht importiert. Wähle „Import abschließen“, um es erneut zu versuchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file of the old LockPlus helper is still installed. LockPlus can remove it; macOS asks for an administrator password." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 banner: only the helper's binary is left (Fable pre-release A-4)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Datei des Hilfsprogramms des alten LockPlus ist noch installiert. LockPlus kann sie entfernen; macOS fragt dafür nach einem Administratorpasswort."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old LockPlus is still connected or its kill switch is on, so its helper wasn't removed. Disconnect in the old LockPlus first, or restart your Mac, then try again. If you also use WireGuide, its kill switch counts too: turn it off for the removal." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused (E2E-5 F1; migration matrix: the pf anchor is shared with upstream WireGuide)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das alte LockPlus ist noch verbunden oder sein Kill Switch ist an, deshalb wurde sein Hilfsprogramm nicht entfernt. Trenne zuerst die Verbindung im alten LockPlus oder starte deinen Mac neu und versuche es dann erneut. Wenn du auch WireGuide verwendest, zählt dessen Kill Switch ebenfalls: Schalte ihn für das Entfernen aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: the old LockPlus kept this password in the System keychain, which LockPlus can't read. Enter it again on first connect." : {
      "comment" : "Migration report: a System keychain item of LockPlus 1.0.65 and older (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@: Das alte LockPlus hat dieses Passwort im System-Schlüsselbund gesichert, den LockPlus nicht lesen kann. Gib es bei der ersten Verbindung erneut ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LockPlus replaces it. You can put it back from the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation message (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LockPlus ersetzt es. Du kannst es aus dem Papierkorb zurücklegen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move WireGuide+ to the Trash?" : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation: the old WireGuide+ app (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WireGuide+ in den Papierkorb legen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash" : {
      "comment" : "Button, confirmation (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In den Papierkorb legen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to Trash…" : {
      "comment" : "Button, banner: the old WireGuide+ app (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In den Papierkorb legen…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WireGuide's profiles (the separate app) are on this Mac too. LockPlus doesn't import them on its own: choose Import Profile… and pick them in ~/Library/Application Support/wireguide/tunnels." : {
      "comment" : "Migration report: upstream WireGuide's directory is never imported automatically (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf diesem Mac sind auch Profile von WireGuide (der separaten App). LockPlus importiert sie nicht von selbst: Wähle „Profil importieren…“ und wähle sie in ~/Library/Application Support/wireguide/tunnels aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WireGuide+ couldn't be moved to the Trash. Drag it from Applications to the Trash yourself." : {
      "comment" : "Banner: moving the old app failed (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WireGuide+ konnte nicht in den Papierkorb gelegt werden. Ziehe es selbst aus „Programme“ in den Papierkorb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WireGuide+, the old version of LockPlus, is still installed. LockPlus replaces it." : {
      "comment" : "Banner: the old WireGuide+ app is still installed (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WireGuide+, die alte Version von LockPlus, ist noch installiert. LockPlus ersetzt es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WireGuide+, the old version of LockPlus, is still running. Quit it, then you can move it to the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Banner: the old WireGuide+ app runs (migration matrix)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WireGuide+, die alte Version von LockPlus, läuft noch. Beende es, dann kannst du es in den Papierkorb legen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old LockPlus helper isn't running, and the DNS settings it changed may still be active. Open the old LockPlus once so its helper restores DNS, or set DNS back to Automatic in System Settings › Network and try again, or restart your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused: un-replayed DNS journal, the old app is installed (E2E-6 N1)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Hilfsprogramm des alten LockPlus läuft nicht, und die DNS-Einstellungen, die es geändert hat, sind vielleicht noch aktiv. Öffne das alte LockPlus einmal, damit sein Hilfsprogramm DNS wiederherstellt, oder stelle DNS in Systemeinstellungen › Netzwerk wieder auf „Automatisch“ und versuche es erneut, oder starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old LockPlus helper isn't running, and the DNS settings it changed may still be active. Set DNS back to Automatic in System Settings › Network and try again, or restart your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused: un-replayed DNS journal, no old app to open (E2E-6 N1)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Hilfsprogramm des alten LockPlus läuft nicht, und die DNS-Einstellungen, die es geändert hat, sind vielleicht noch aktiv. Stelle DNS in Systemeinstellungen › Netzwerk wieder auf „Automatisch“ und versuche es erneut, oder starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old LockPlus left its DNS protection on. Restart your Mac to clear it, then remove the helper." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused: only 1.0.x's port-53 pf rules are left (E2E-6 N2)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das alte LockPlus hat seinen DNS-Schutz eingeschaltet gelassen. Starte deinen Mac neu, um ihn zu entfernen, und entferne danach das Hilfsprogramm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old LockPlus still seems to be connected, so its helper wasn't removed. Disconnect LockPlus and try again: its connection can look like one of the old LockPlus. If that doesn't help, disconnect in the old LockPlus or restart your Mac." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused by root while LockPlus itself is connected (E2E-7 F3: its utun can reuse a crashed old tunnel's number)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das alte LockPlus scheint noch verbunden zu sein, deshalb wurde sein Hilfsprogramm nicht entfernt. Trenne die Verbindung in LockPlus und versuche es erneut: Seine Verbindung kann wie eine des alten LockPlus aussehen. Hilft das nicht, trenne die Verbindung im alten LockPlus oder starte deinen Mac neu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old helper isn't responding. Restart your Mac, then remove it." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused: the helper's socket doesn't answer (Fable follow-up LOW-3)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das alte Hilfsprogramm reagiert nicht. Starte deinen Mac neu und entferne es dann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart your Mac — the old helper then restores your DNS settings — then remove it." : {
      "comment" : "§4.5 removal refused: the journal holds the user's own DNS servers (review 650b251)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starte deinen Mac neu – das alte Hilfsprogramm stellt dann deine DNS-Einstellungen wieder her – und entferne es danach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask to add VPN configurations first: choose “Allow”. The keychain prompts follow." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 4 hint by the import button, with saved logins included",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS fragt zuerst, ob VPN-Konfigurationen hinzugefügt werden dürfen: Wähle „Erlauben“. Danach folgen die Schlüsselbund-Abfragen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask to add VPN configurations: choose “Allow”." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 4 hint by the import button",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS fragt, ob VPN-Konfigurationen hinzugefügt werden dürfen: Wähle „Erlauben“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld directive](inflect: true) not applied" : {
      "comment" : "Import report summary; directives whose behaviour LockPlus does not apply (scripts, certificate pin, web sign-in, WireGuard settings)",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld Direktive nicht angewendet"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld Direktiven nicht angewendet"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has already allowed LockPlus to add VPN configurations." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 3 with no profile but an existing VPN configuration: nothing more to allow",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat LockPlus bereits erlaubt, VPN-Konfigurationen hinzuzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "keepalive is set, which takes precedence" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "keepalive ist gesetzt und hat Vorrang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "web sign-in isn't supported; the setting is removed" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Web-Anmeldung wird nicht unterstützt; die Einstellung wird entfernt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not applied on macOS" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "unter macOS nicht angewendet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "unknown key; kept for export, not applied" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "unbekannter Schlüssel; für den Export behalten, nicht angewendet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "lines starting with ';' are skipped" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeilen, die mit „;“ beginnen, werden übersprungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not supported; the certificate chain is still verified, use peer-fingerprint to pin the server" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "nicht unterstützt; die Zertifikatskette wird trotzdem geprüft, mit peer-fingerprint legst du den Server fest"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your cipher list isn't applied; LockPlus's engine negotiates the cipher itself" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "deine Verschlüsselungsliste wird nicht angewendet; die Engine von LockPlus handelt die Verschlüsselung selbst aus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LockPlus accepts compressed data from the server (asym); “no” isn't enforced" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LockPlus akzeptiert komprimierte Daten vom Server (asym); „no“ wird nicht erzwungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "rekey/replay tuning isn't applied; LockPlus uses the engine's defaults" : {
      "comment" : "Import reason, ignored directive",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feineinstellungen für Neuverhandlung und Replay-Schutz werden nicht angewendet; LockPlus nutzt die Standardwerte der Engine"
          }
        }
      }
